{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Magic systems differ in their bookkeeping, not in their effects. An at-will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cantrip, a spell memorized from a book and spent in the speaking, a bolt paid"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for out of an energy pool, and a scroll good for one reading all do the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sort of thing to the world; what separates them is when the game says no. This"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"library keeps the two apart. A spell’s effect is an ordinary rule body, written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exactly as any other rule body is, and a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost","type":"reference"},{"text":" sits beside it deciding","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"availability and price.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A spell’s identity is its own intent, declared with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#verb"},{"type":"text","text":" like any custom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verb, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"glow"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cast glow"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"read passwall"},{"type":"text","text":" are parser rows and a spell can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carry as many phrasings as its author wants. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/spell(_:called:cost:effect:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns the actions that intent needs — the cast handler, plus the memorize"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"handler when the cost is "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/prepared(book:learnVia:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" — and the game"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"splices them into its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actions"},{"type":"text","text":" block."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The layer’s own lines name a spell by its ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"word","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — “You fix the unbar spell in your memory” — which is the intent’s name unless "},{"code":"called:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" says otherwise. An intent that is not a word a player reads, "},{"code":"#verb(\"castFire\", …)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", wants "},{"code":"called: \"fire\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or every line about it says “the castFire spell”. The word is display and nothing more: memory is keyed on the intent, so two spells may share a word and are still memorized, cast and spent one at a time."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is a "},{"code":"GameContent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" bundle rather than a "},{"code":"GamePlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", because it has state to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"save. The finite spell memory and the energy pool are "},{"code":"@Global","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"s it owns, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"both travel in a save and come back correctly under UNDO; the defaults are 3"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"slots and 12 mana. Everything else is the host’s: the spellbook, the scroll, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"targets, and every word of prose an effect prints. The bundle contributes one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verb of its own — "},{"code":"spells","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (or "},{"code":"magic","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), which reports what is held in mind and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"how much energy is left — promotes the engine’s "},{"code":"rest","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" stub to refilling the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pool (and teaches it "},{"code":"meditate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and adds ","type":"text"},{"code":"spell","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to the parser’s noise words,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so ","type":"text"},{"code":"cast the glow spell","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reaches ","type":"text"},{"code":"glow","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Its own lines are a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Text"},{"text":", passed at init.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Casting runs gate, effect, pay. Availability is checked first; the effect runs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"second and may refuse on its own account with "},{"code":"require","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reply"},{"text":"; only an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"effect that finished pays. So a firebolt aimed at nothing costs no energy, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"scroll read at the wrong wall survives."}]},{"anchor":"Wiring-it-in","type":"heading","text":"Wiring it in","level":2},{"code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoSpellcasting","","extension Intent {","    #verb(\"glow\", [\"glow\"], [\"cast\", \"glow\"])","    #verb(","        \"firebolt\", [\"firebolt\"], [\"cast\", \"firebolt\"],","        [\"firebolt\", .directObject], [\"cast\", \"firebolt\", \"at\", .directObject])","}","","struct Tower: Game {","    let magic = Spellcasting(memorySlots: 3, maxMana: 12)","","    var content: GameContents { magic }","    var verbs: [SyntaxRule] { [.glow, .firebolt] }","","    var actions: [IntentAction] {","        magic.spell(.glow, cost: .cantrip) {","            say(\"Pale light seeps from your fingers.\")","        }","        magic.spell(.firebolt, cost: .energy(4)) {","            guard let target = command.directObject else {","                try reply(\"Cast firebolt at what?\")","            }","            target.vanish()","            say(\"Fire leaps from your hand and bursts against \\(target.definiteName).\")","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/prepared(book:learnVia:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" spell carries its own memorize intent,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the one ","type":"text"},{"code":"spell(_:called:cost:effect:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" call registers both halves:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["magic.spell(.unbar, cost: .prepared(book: spellbook, learnVia: .learnUnbar)) {","    try require(!wardedDoor.isOpen, else: \"The door already stands open.\")","    wardedDoor.isOpen = true","    say(\"The warding-marks gutter and die, and the door drifts open.\")","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"book: nil"},{"type":"text","text":" and the spell can be memorized anywhere; pass an item and it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has to be in hand."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"One memorize verb per prepared spell. ","type":"text"},{"code":"learnVia","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" registers a stage-4 action on that intent, and two spells declaring the same one collide: the bootstrap keeps the later and warns that it overrides the earlier. ","type":"text"},{"code":"memorize unbar","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"memorize seal","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are two intents, not one ","type":"text"},{"code":"memorize","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with an object.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"The-worked-example","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"The worked example"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Gramarye\/"},{"type":"text","text":" is a small original game built to test the claim in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first sentence of this page. It runs one spell per paradigm and chains them so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each opens exactly one obstacle: the cantrip finds the scroll, the memorized"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spell opens the warded door, the energy spell destroys the golem, the scroll"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passes the wall. Remove any one of the four and the amulet is unreachable, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is a stronger demonstration than four spells that happen to work. Its design"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document is "},{"code":"docs\/games\/gramarye.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Four ways a spell becomes available, over one way of writing what it does."}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","role":"collection","externalID":"GnustoSpellcasting","roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"GnustoSpellcasting"}],"title":"GnustoSpellcasting"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/init(memorySlots:maxMana:text:)","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/memorySlots","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/maxMana"],"title":"The bundle","anchor":"The-bundle"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Text","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/SpellList","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Energy"],"title":"The system’s voice","anchor":"The-systems-voice"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/spell(_:called:cost:effect:)"],"title":"Registering a spell","anchor":"Registering-a-spell"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/cantrip","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/prepared(book:learnVia:)","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/energy(_:)","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/scroll(_:)"],"title":"The four paradigms","anchor":"The-four-paradigms"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/verbs","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/actions","doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/noiseWords"],"title":"What the bundle contributes to the host","anchor":"What-the-bundle-contributes-to-the-host"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Gnusto"],"title":"Extended Modules","anchor":"Extended-Modules","generated":true}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/SpellList":{"title":"Spellcasting.SpellList","abstract":[{"text":"What ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Text\/spellsHeld"},{"type":"text","text":" is about: the names held in mind, sorted."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Interpolating one prints them as an English list."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SpellList"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/SpellList","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SpellList","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/spelllist"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/verbs":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/verbs","url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/verbs","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The verbs the spellcasting layer contributes: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"spells"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"magic"},{"type":"text","text":", which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports the caster’s state, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"meditate"},{"type":"text","text":" as a second word for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"engine’s own "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rest"},{"type":"text","text":", which "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/actions","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" promotes to refilling the pool."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"verbs","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"SyntaxRule","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10SyntaxRuleV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"verbs"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting":{"title":"Spellcasting","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A reusable spellcasting layer covering the common RPG magic paradigms —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at-will cantrips, memorized (“Vancian”) spells, an energy\/points pool, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one-shot scrolls — over a single, uniform notion of a spell."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Spellcasting","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Spellcasting"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/Text":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/Text","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/text","abstract":[{"text":"The system’s own voice — every line the mechanics print, from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refusals at the availability gate to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"spells","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" report. A spell’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"effect","type":"text"}]},{"text":" is the game’s prose and never passes through here. Override","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lines at init to re-skin.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Text"}],"title":"Spellcasting.Text"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/SpellCost":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"SpellCost","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcost","abstract":[{"text":"How a spell becomes available to cast, and what casting it costs — the axis","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that lets one spellcasting system express the common RPG magic paradigms","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without changing how a spell’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"effect"}]},{"text":" is written.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SpellCost"}],"title":"SpellCost"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/SpellCost/prepared(book:learnVia:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"prepared","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"book","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Item","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"learnVia","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Intent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto6IntentV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/prepared(book:learnVia:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcost\/prepared(book:learnvia:)","abstract":[{"text":"Must be memorized into the caster’s finite spell memory before casting,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and is spent on cast. "},{"code":"learnVia","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the memorize\/learn intent that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"commits it to memory — one per spell, since two spells sharing it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"register two actions on one intent and the later one wins. When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"book"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is set, memorizing requires that spellbook be in hand; when nil, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spell can be memorized anywhere."}],"role":"symbol","title":"SpellCost.prepared(book:learnVia:)"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/noiseWords":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"“spell” is filler in a casting game — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cast the glow spell"},{"type":"text","text":" should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parse as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cast glow"},{"type":"text","text":" — so the layer adds it to the parser’s noise set."}],"title":"noiseWords","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/noiseWords","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"noiseWords","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/noisewords"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/actions":{"title":"actions","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The default actions the spellcasting layer contributes: the "},{"code":"rest","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"handler that restores the energy pool to full, and the ","type":"text"},{"code":"spells","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" status","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"report of memorized spells and remaining energy.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"actions","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"text":"IntentAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto12IntentActionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/actions","url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/actions"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/SpellCost/energy(_:)":{"title":"SpellCost.energy(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Draws the given amount from the shared magical-energy pool; refused when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the pool is too low. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rest"},{"type":"text","text":" restores the pool to full."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"energy","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/SpellCost\/energy(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcost\/energy(_:)"},"doc://GnustoSpellcasting/documentation/GnustoSpellcasting/Spellcasting/maxMana":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoSpellcasting\/documentation\/GnustoSpellcasting\/Spellcasting\/maxMana","type":"topic","title":"maxMana","abstract":[{"text":"The full magical-energy pool ","type":"text"},{"code":"rest","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" restores to.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustospellcasting\/spellcasting\/maxmana","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxMana","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{